griculture.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"20 FR 1761, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 1(a)","sha256":"dc859df841c312bf927e04119b976c11278a7cbbf259f7e80be6220f6a4731a4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1955-03-24/pdf/FR-1955-03-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10601#sec1(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) The authority delegated by this \norder is exclusive of the authority to de­\nclare any national emergency.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"20 FR 1761, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 1(b)","sha256":"dc859df841c312bf927e04119b976c11278a7cbbf259f7e80be6220f6a4731a4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1955-03-24/pdf/FR-1955-03-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10601#sec1(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S ec. 2. Functions under Title I re­\nspecting the disposal outside the United \nStates of commodities in the commodity \nset-aside shall be subject to the responsi­\nbilities of the Secretary of State with \nrespect to the foreign policy of the \nUnited States as such policy relates to \nthe said functions.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"20 FR 1761, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 2","sha256":"dc859df841c312bf927e04119b976c11278a7cbbf259f7e80be6220f6a4731a4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1955-03-24/pdf/FR-1955-03-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10601#sec2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 3. Strategic materials shall be ac­\nquired under section 103 (a) (2) of Title \nI only in accordance with programs cer­\ntified by the Director of the Office of De­\nfense Mobilization.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"20 FR 1761, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 3","sha256":"dc859df841c312bf927e04119b976c11278a7cbbf259f7e80be6220f6a4731a4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1955-03-24/pdf/FR-1955-03-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10601#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 4. Existing procedures of coordi­\nnation among Federal agencies per­\ntaining to the disposal of agricultural \nsurpluses under other laws shall be ap­\nplicable, so far as is permitted by law and \notherwise appropriate, in the carrying \nout of Title I.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"20 FR 1761, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 4","sha256":"dc859df841c312bf927e04119b976c11278a7cbbf259f7e80be6220f6a4731a4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1955-03-24/pdf/FR-1955-03-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10601#sec4","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 5. The provisions of Part II of \nExecutive Order No. 10575 of November \n6, 1954 (19 F. R. 7252) are hereby ex­\ntended and made applicable to the carry­\ning on abroad of functions under Title I.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"20 FR 1761, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 5","sha256":"dc859df841c312bf927e04119b976c11278a7cbbf259f7e80be6220f6a4731a4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1955-03-24/pdf/FR-1955-03-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10601#sec5","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 6. This order shall not be deemed \nto amend or supersede any provisions of \nExecutive Order No. 10560 of September \n9, 1954 (19 F. R. 5927). -","original_source":{"page_or_item":"20 FR 1761, PDF pages 1-1; Sec. 6","sha256":"dc859df841c312bf927e04119b976c11278a7cbbf259f7e80be6220f6a4731a4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1955-03-24/pdf/FR-1955-03-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10601#sec6","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"20 FR 1761, PDF pages 1-1","sha256":"dc859df841c312bf927e04119b976c11278a7cbbf259f7e80be6220f6a4731a4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1955-03-24/pdf/FR-1955-03-24.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_resi